kokoro.cpp — standalone CPU inference for Kokoro-82M TTS

Provenance
----------

The inference code in this project is derived from CrispASR
(https://github.com/CrispStrobe/CrispASR), which implements the Kokoro
TTS runtime among many other speech models. The extraction:

  - Preserves all inference-critical math (forward pass graphs, GGUF
    tensor naming, tokenizer, iSTFT, SineGen) to ensure bit-equivalent
    output with the upstream CrispASR implementation.
  - Removes GPU backends, multi-model orchestration, caching, and
    non-Kokoro code paths.
  - Renames symbols from CRISPASR_*/crispasr_* to KOKORO_*/kokoro_*.
  - Simplifies to require espeak-ng as a direct linked dependency.

